        "date": "2026-11-17T10:23:35Z"
      },
      "message": "Add DevFlow.Protocol and use it from the worker routes\n\nThe worker API's paths, its two requests and their JSON move into a project of their own,\nwhich Dev flow's hello and jobs/next routes now take and the worker program will send, so a\nchange that breaks either side fails to compile. The type names are kept, so the contract's\nschemas are unchanged; mapping the routes outside a group only reorders two tags. The\nhosted image copies the new project, since Dev flow now references it.",
